      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تخافّ</span></b>  <i>He pressed,</i> or <i>bore, lightly</i> [upon a
thing]; <i>contr. of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تثاقل</span>. (K, * TA.) Hence the
saying, in a trad., <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِذَا سَجَدْتَ فَتَخَافَّ</span> explained
above: see 1, second sentence. (TA.)

